"View details of <skillId> Skill (including AI prompt and schema)"
}
]
}
}
,
"create"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"创建 Page — 上传 AI 生成的 HTML/ZIP 模板文件并生成分享链接。\n需要先通过 `x hub site skill ls/info` 选择一个 Skill 模板。\n上传成功后返回 Page ID 和分享链接（shareUrl）。Page 创建后可通过 `site entry add` 追加数据。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Create a Page by uploading an AI-generated HTML/ZIP template file and generating a share link.\nYou must first choose a Skill template via `x hub site skill ls/info`.\nReturns Page ID and share URL upon success. After creation, append data with `site entry add`.\n"
}
,
"--skill|-s"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"指定 Skill ID（从 `x hub site skill ls` 获取可用的 Skill 列表）"
