{
"cn"
:
"管理 Page 的图片资源。上传的图片返回相对路径，可在 Entry 的 images 字段或模板中引用。\n仅允许 jpeg/png/gif/webp（SVG 因 XSS 风险被禁）。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Manage image assets for a Page. Uploaded images return a relative path for referencing in entry images fields or templates.\nOnly jpeg/png/gif/webp are allowed (SVG is blocked due to XSS risk).\n"
}
,
"upload|put"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"上传一张图片到 Page，返回 imageId 和相对路径"
,
"en"
:
"Upload an image to the Page, returning imageId and relative path"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"站点 ID"
,
"en"
:
"Site ID"
}
}
,
"#2"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"本地图片文件路径（jpeg/png/gif/webp），最大 5MB"
,
"en"
:
"Local image file path (jpeg/png/gif/webp), max 5MB"
}
,
"#exec"
:
"___x_cmd_advise__file"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x hub site media upload <siteId> <image>"
,
"cn"
:
"上传图片并获取相对路径"
,
"en"
:
"Upload an image and get the relative path"
}
]
}
}
}

